= BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_EventScript_TuckerWonDraw
msgbox	The REFEREES have reached a decision!The winner is… Oh, my goodness! The winner is our very own DOME ACE! It's TUCKER!Congratulations! And thank you! Let's hear it for the DOME ACE, TUCKER!
waitmessage
