msgbox	PLAYER is the Level 50 Battle Tournament Champion!Congratulations!
goto BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_EventScript_CelebrateWin
= BattleFrontier_BattleDomeBattleRoom_EventScript_CelebrateWin
